    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/extras/440086cc67971ce6aa0d433450800cf1.poster.avif?t=1747096120\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/extras/440086cc67971ce6aa0d433450800cf1.webm?t=1747096120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/extras/440086cc67971ce6aa0d433450800cf1.mp4?t=1747096120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyber Haze</strong> is a retro-style 2.5D platformer in which Haze, a delivery robot, must defend his world against a horde of viruses that have begun to take over the digital world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haze is just a delivery robot, doing his job as usual at Alpha City, when suddenly...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge vortex opens up in the middle of cyberspace and strange creatures known as\u00a0<strong>VIROIDS\u00a0</strong>begin to spread through the cyber zones. To make matters worse, the defense unit system, aka <strong>D.U.S.T</strong> was completely corrupted! <strong>It's up to Haze to use his new combat abilities, given by an ancient being, to deal with this crisis.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/extras/edd6d4f73e242b6582ff1ed7edef939a.avif?t=1747096120\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of places with unique aesthetics, collect cybernetic power-ups to boost Haze's strength and agility, and battle the viral threat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover each cyber zone, filled with secrets, alternative paths, medals, and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each power-up temporarily changes how Haze looks and plays, with new moves and attacks to aid your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are extra challenges and minigames to unlock in the overworld</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectathon: Unlock the secrets of cyberspace by finding all the prism medals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the bytes you collect through the stages in the game shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and fluid controls that provide an enjoyable experience.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/extras/440086cc67971ce6aa0d433450800cf1.poster.avif?t=1747096120\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/extras/440086cc67971ce6aa0d433450800cf1.webm?t=1747096120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/extras/440086cc67971ce6aa0d433450800cf1.mp4?t=1747096120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyber Haze</strong> is a retro-style 2.5D platformer in which Haze, a delivery robot, must defend his world against a horde of viruses that have begun to take over the digital world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haze is just a delivery robot, doing his job as usual at Alpha City, when suddenly...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A huge vortex opens up in the middle of cyberspace and strange creatures known as\u00a0<strong>VIROIDS\u00a0</strong>begin to spread through the cyber zones. To make matters worse, the defense unit system, aka <strong>D.U.S.T</strong> was completely corrupted! <strong>It's up to Haze to use his new combat abilities, given by an ancient being, to deal with this crisis.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724420/extras/edd6d4f73e242b6582ff1ed7edef939a.avif?t=1747096120\" width=600 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of places with unique aesthetics, collect cybernetic power-ups to boost Haze's strength and agility, and battle the viral threat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover each cyber zone, filled with secrets, alternative paths, medals, and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each power-up temporarily changes how Haze looks and plays, with new moves and attacks to aid your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are extra challenges and minigames to unlock in the overworld</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectathon: Unlock the secrets of cyberspace by finding all the prism medals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the bytes you collect through the stages in the game shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and fluid controls that provide an enjoyable experience.</p></li></ul>",
